== Cold starts on Render (AC6; b4_cold.sh / b4_cold_chain.sh; raw Render logs kept local) ==
Render's own health checker calls /health every 5 s from internal addresses while an instance is up; those are not
visitor traffic. A cold start counts only with no visitor request in the window, a logged shutdown, and a fresh
server process after the probe.
